WEBVTT

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.620
And the winner is... Matenro!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.870
Amemura, you little...

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.540
Ooh, scary!

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.750
She is majorly pissed.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:45.200
She's a monster. That lady's not Beauty;
she's the Beast. Eh-hehehehe.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.500
All righty then, let's go! Dice! Gentaro!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.700
Ah, I'm all tapped out.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.540
"The losers leave quietly," as they say.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.580
Ramuda! You might have lost,
but you were still cute!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.330
Ladies!

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.120
I did my best, you know!

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.160
Thanks for cheering us on!

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.160
See you later!

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:18.620
I'll take Beauties over Beasts
any day of the week!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.870
Oh, Ms. Beast~! I'm over here~!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.290
Come and get me whenever!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:03.660
Or I can go to you, if you like.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.330
If you don't get a move on,
I'll run off somewhere!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.000
Why didn't I think of that before?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.370
That's it!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.290
I should've just run off somewhere.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.160
Sorry, guys.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.160
This is where I disappear.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.500
After that, you guys can
do whatever the hell you want.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:33.540
But knowing those Chuohku bitches,
they'll nab the both of them for sure.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:38.200
And I wouldn't be surprised if they used
torture to find out my whereabouts.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.410
But no, it's <i>my </i>life that's on the line here.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:46.160
Sorry guys, but I don't have the
time to think about anyone but myself.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.790
Ye have botched your lines.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.620
The hero, with his cheerful and
playful demeanor, is the life of the party

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:57.580
and gloriously defeateth his foes in the end.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.790
There must be a splendor about it.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:05.910
Aye, the hero of my tale is... thee.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.000
Now that I think of it,

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.290
Gentaro's words sounded like
they came straight out of a boys' comic

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.580
and weren't like him at all.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:28.450
Here! You can have my 100,000 luckies!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.080
Tsk. God damn it.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.540
'Kay guys!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.370
Listen up, you two!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.080
'Sup?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.250
Is something the matter, Ramuda?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.500
We're leaving here right now.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.870
Let's go back to Shibuya!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.660
Huh? Let's watch the finals first.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:49.410
Methinks the battle between Yokohama
and Shinjuku is sure to be impressive.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:54.040
Right about now, everyone's eyes are glued
to the division battle, so Shibuya's a ghost town.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.450
The slots are paying out never-ending jackpots.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.660
No effin' way!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:04.370
And the streets are quiet.
It's the perfect environment to write your tales.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.040
Hmm. Indubitably.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:12.120
Anyhoo, the two of you are
leaving here with me immediately!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.580
It was my fault for trusting Amemura.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.000
I will deal with him straight away.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.250
There is nowhere for him to go.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.700
It is almost time for the long-awaited
final match. Let us enjoy ourselves.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.790
When my attempt to
lead Matenro into battle failed,

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:33.790
this stream of verbal abuse started going
full blast inside my panic-stricken head.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.500
I remembered all the crap
that happened to me in the past.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.790
Then I just got seriously pissed off.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.700
And before I knew it...

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.950
...Doppomine the dissed
stone guardian had totally lost it

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.750
and transformed into the "God of Dissing."

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.330
Man, I better pray to you.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:49.910
Amen!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:53.660
Nevertheless, such an abrupt fluctuation

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.660
must pose a considerable burden on your psyche.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.330
Please bear that in mind.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.620
I sure will, Doctor.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.910
Um...

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.370
Thank you.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:07.830
I'm... truly grateful.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:11.950
That someone like me could make it
this far--it's all thanks to you, Doctor.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:14.410
It's the result of everyone's hard work.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:19.080
Doppo. Hifumi. The two of
you must be exhausted as well.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.200
Why don't I go buy us
something nutritious to drink?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.450
Th-That's something we could--

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.580
Huh? Wh-What?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:34.160
We should give the good doctor
some alone time, if just for a little while.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.500
Whenever he's with us,

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:38.500
he's always attending to our needs
and never gets a moment's peace.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.910
Plus, it looks like something's eating at him...

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.500
R-Really?

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.620
Are you worried?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:53.500
--What about?
--About your younger sister.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.580
You saw her, didn't you? In the audience.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.200
I might've been hallucinatin'...

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.200
Or you might not have been.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.410
She's here, isn't she?
Your younger sister. In Chuohku.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.540
It seems she is.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.250
People usually ask the police
to search for missing persons, you know.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.910
I shall also aid you in your search.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:23.790
A search-and-rescue mission is no
easy task when you're in enemy territory.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:30.370
You guys helped me plenty in order to
give that bastard Ichiro a good ass-whippin'.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.120
So, we could help you once more...

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:36.500
I don't wanna get you
mixed up in my family business.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.700
You guys just stick
to fightin' your own battles!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.540
This is my mess,
and I've gotta deal with it myself.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.910
Where are you going?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.540
Out for a smoke.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.450
Nemu!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:07.500
Nemu! Nemu! <i>Nemu</i>! <i>Nemu</i>!

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:16.750
No one except for Chuohku personnel
is allowed beyond this point.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:20.700
But Nemu just--my little sister
just passed through here.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.330
Lemme through!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.750
I've gotta talk with Nemu...

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.160
--Please leave.
--This ain't funny!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.750
Step aside! You're in my way!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.700
What the--?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.410
Oh, it's you, Doc...

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:34.660
Let us head back.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.500
If this altercation gets too intense,

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.290
I may no longer be able to fight you on stage.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:54.500
Was there someone
you wanted to see in Chuohku?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.500
Everybody's got some
kinda baggage in their lives...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.080
I know what you mean.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.500
I wouldn't call it "baggage," but...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.750
I, too, have something similar.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.450
Is there some link between
your baggage and Chuohku too, Doc?

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.580
Well, I'm afraid I don't know.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:18.950
But I suspected that a thorough
investigation might lead me here.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:25.290
I see... But anyway, my baggage ain't
got nothin' to do with me bein' here.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:30.580
It was MAD TRIGGER CREW--me and
those guys that opened up these gates.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:37.250
How far did the good doctor go?

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.580
It's almost time for the finals.
He's cutting it a bit too close for comfort.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.330
--Oh! Doc--
--Hold up, Doppomine!

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.080
Yes, I know what you mean.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:54.660
I wouldn't be here either if it weren't
for Matenro and our team solidarity.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:10:03.500
Each of us relied on his own strength
to fight his way ahead, by force or whatever.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:08.120
It's crazy, but that's why we
can trust each other to watch our backs.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.790
Doc... it ain't my place to say this, but...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:15.200
...the way we see it,
your team's got a glarin' weak point.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.870
It's those other two you chose
to be your teammates.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.000
Gulp!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:23.870
No. It was their--or rather, our weaknesses

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.870
that enabled Matenro to make it to the finals.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.750
Each of us has revealed
our weaknesses, accepted them,

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.910
and compensated for them. This connects us.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:37.450
It is because of this bond
that we've made it this far as a team.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.500
Strength and a bond, huh?

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.870
That total opposites like us
would fight each other in the finals...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.120
That don't sound like such a bad idea.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.080
It should prove to be a fascinating battle.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.500
Strength... If only I had been stronger,

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.660
perhaps I could have done something for him.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.250
A bond, huh...

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.750
Were you and I connected?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:15.040
Doc. I hate to tell ya this,
but we're gonna crush you guys.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.750
We accept your challenge.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.200
The time has finally come, Brother Ichi.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.580
This battle will decide
the division battle champion.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.450
I'm so bummed that we aren't down there.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.910
But I'll burn this bummed-out
feeling into my memory

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.330
and make sure that next time
we'll be the ones standing on that stage.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:43.250
Samatoki and Dr. Jakurai... This battle
may show us what true strength really is.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.160
The final battle has come at last!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.790
We've observed many scenes involving them.

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.660
This is the final act.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:12:00.750
Winners and losers alike,
show us how strong your passion is!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:07.160
The final match of the
division rap battle will now begin!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.750
Which of the teams
will shine at its lyrical peak?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.870
MAD TRIGGER CREW and Matenro
will make their entrance!

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:31.540
Seeing that we've made it this far,
let's give it our all and leave no regrets.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.040
Sure! Just watch us, Doctor!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.540
We'll show them how it's done!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:40.950
We're gonna take 'em! So, you guys
had better let loose all your strength!

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.580
Very well.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.700
I plan to use up all my ammo.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.040
And the first attack goes to...
MAD TRIGGER CREW!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.120
And now, for the final battle!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.080
Get Ready...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.000
Bring The Beat!!!

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.790
I'll be the first to go into action.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.200
♬ Answer my questions one by one ♬

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.410
♬ Rising tension (friction)
I don't want any of that, son ♬

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.080
♬ Trembling and cowed
Sweat beading on your brow ♬

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.290
♬ You don't have the balls to get
yourself out of the mess you're in now ♬

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.790
♬ Your chances are one percent ♬

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:27.250
♬ Guess I should compliment
you for trying anyhow ♬

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.870
♬ How audacious, making these outrageous jokes ♬

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.830
♬ You comedians belong in the can ♬

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.790
♬ I might be trash, but don't mess with me
My agenda is victory ♬

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.750
♬ Losing would be a disgrace, you see
Prostrating myself is no longer the key ♬

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.200
♬ Together with the hopes of us three
My frozen heart has melted already ♬

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.330
♬ Ever since I was a little kiddie ♬

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.290
♬ My weapon's been that I don't quit
anything until I'm bored and over it ♬

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.200
♬ It's already the last train, last station ♬

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.750
♬ A train that sells your soul
Boogie down to the end! ♬

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.790
Not even a scratch.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.700
It's my turn.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:09.200
♬ Those clinging to their crumbling dreams
In a city full of dark depravity ♬

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.290
♬ Let me be plain here, I'm your new trainer ♬

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.250
♬ To a Spartan boot camp you've gained admittance ♬

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.120
♬ But your ideal selves are still in the distance ♬

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.450
♬ Do you trash understand
there's no path of least resistance? ♬

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.910
♬ Only those with the perseverance
to overcome any hindrance ♬

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.500
♬ Are soldiers worthy
Of today's victory ♬

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.160
Now it's my turn. Here goes!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.290
♬ The lyrics scribbled on the backs of receipts ♬

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.250
♬ Are the signature of my sincerity ♬

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.910
♬ Going in blind,
tackling these days with temerity ♬

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.290
♬ You don't know what libido means? ♬

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.540
♬ Matenro, such a tight combo, tighter than a vise ♬

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.330
♬ A lifeline as we climb unprecedented heights ♬

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.330
♬ My comrades' names
will be first on everybody's lips ♬

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.950
♬ When they're talking about the hottest gossip ♬

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.790
They don't try to diss their opponents.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.500
That's their...

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.120
Well, it looks like MAD TRIGGER CREW's
power-ups are pretty brutal.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.830
In comparison, I get the
impression that Matenro's attacks

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.950
are a bit on the mild side, Brother Ichi.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:09.330
Still, the feelings they
communicate tug at your heartstrings.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.500
Hifumi. Doppo.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.500
How's that? Are we doing okay, Doctor?

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.290
I think that's fine.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.040
We may be weak,

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:23.160
but we'll reveal our weaknesses and
maintain our connection with you, Doctor!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.040
In that case, we'll...

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:29.290
...riddle you from head
to toe with our rhyme bullets!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.790
♬ You kids who grew up in the dump, marooned ♬

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.750
♬ Where "friendship" meant
licking each other's wounds ♬

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.250
♬ Listen up
A loser's walk home is filled with squalor ♬

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.250
♬ Have someone help you take off that collar ♬

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.250
♬ Your firepower's as weak
as your backbone, mister ♬

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.660
♬ Flattering your comrades is a mistake, sir
So before we pull the trigger ♬

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.910
♬ Why don't I silence that yammering
windpipe for you, just in case ♬

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.160
Doppo! Hifumi!

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.750
--We're all right.
--No need to worry.

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.500
Let's let them have it, too!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.410
Yeah!

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:01.290
♬ Roger that, I might not have enough power but ♬

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.290
♬ I'll still rocket launch
my feelings straight from the gut ♬

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.160
♬ I'm seriously serious
I'm here lacing up ♬

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.200
♬ The ties that bind us
like sutures sewing up a cut ♬

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.200
♬ Dr. Jakurai is a hemostat ♬

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.200
♬ He certainly did say that ♬

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.200
♬ He chose us, even though
there's nothing we're good at ♬

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.790
♬ So we duel to repay him in no time flat ♬

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.870
This time, we're taking them down.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:29.120
That goes without saying.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.290
--No way!
--It had no effect on them?!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.290
♬ Rendering us speechless? Simply specious ♬

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:35.290
♬ Nothing but dogmatism from a bombastic buffoon ♬

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.040
♬ Overemphasize cooperation
Coordination Error ♬

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.830
♬ "Target's mind confirmed empty"
That means you're dead, clear as can be! ♬

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.160
Doppo! Hifumi!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.290
If those two don't get up
before the end of the ten-count,

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:01.410
they'll be considered incapable
of fighting and be disqualified.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:07.200
Evidently, our strength
has surpassed your so-called bond.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.830
--It can't be...
--It's not what you think.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.500
By now they have lost the will to fight.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:20.500
Doppo! Hifumi! Are you all right?

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.200
Doc Jakurai.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:28.160
I'll grant you those weaknesses
you were talkin' about.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:32.290
It's your turn, Doc. What's your move gonna be?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:36.450
♬ Living things both great and small
Proof that you're the chosen of them all ♬

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:40.910
♬ The innocent look of a foal
But a gaze that is nonetheless thoughtful ♬

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.160
Brother Ichi! That's...

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.790
...Dr. Jakurai's health recovery skill.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.750
But they haven't fully recovered.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:57.750
So that's the bond you were talkin' about, huh?

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:00.290
It ain't nothin' but...

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.290
♬ A spider's thread to salvation
Tempting like an opioid ♬

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.040
♬ This scam you're running
has gone on for too long, Doc! ♬

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:06.250
♬ In this stagnant atmosphere it's like baby talk ♬

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.160
♬ In a sad and sorry kindergarten
On this blue marble ♬

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:12.200
♬ Only a rhyme
can triumph over power and capital ♬

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.910
♬ These weak blows don't even tickle, no
I ain't messing around, no! ♬

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.450
♬ Ain't this a deathmatch, no? ♬

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.160
♬ True, it is almost like a medicine
To ease the pain of original sin ♬

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.370
♬ There is no excuse to make ♬

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:34.750
♬ But I have faith
In the new age Matenro will create ♬

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.540
Doc Jakurai!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:48.750
I get it, man. Your--nah, your team's style.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:52.700
But you can't win or get back
what you've lost with that alone!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.370
You gotta have strength!

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:57.040
C'mon, let's do this, MAD TRIGGER CREW!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.290
♬ To your con-artist verses I say
Hasta La Vista, baby ♬

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.080
♬ And after today
These bonds will be wiped away ♬

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.160
♬ If you have any last words
Say them before they go unheard ♬

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.250
♬ Since my point-blank bullets
Will permanently shut your trap ♬

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.950
♬ MTC is firing off RPGs ♬

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.910
♬ Your flimsy armor
Won't protect your vulnerabilities ♬

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:11.950
♬ We're aiming to take forcibly
all your hopes and dreams ♬

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.540
♬ No matter how strong your bond,
we'll ensnare you with rhymes like these ♬

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.290
Doppo! Hifumi!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.540
Doctor...

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.870
Thank you...

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.660
I've been waiting for you.

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.330
Welcome back!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.750
Let's show them...

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.200
...all we've got!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.410
You bastards don't know how to stay dead!

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.870
♬ You're running a little hot, MTC ♬

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.790
♬ That smug complacency on
your face is just painful to see ♬

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.700
♬ You're too angry
Like little babies ♬

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.500
♬ To put it simply
You're addicted to brutality ♬

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:44.120
♬ Profit matters not to me
All who ail, I'll gladly see ♬

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.000
♬ All the same, I'll need your history
I am the MC ♬

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.200
♬ Selflessly at his patients' side
The good doctor will heal the world certainly ♬

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.410
♬ Egocentricity
Is like a disease ♬

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.040
♬ So we'll topple you with ease ♬

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.080
Jyuto! Rio!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.410
Samatoki! I know you can do it!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.870
Trust your strength!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:21.540
Now you've gone and done it. Well, fine by me!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.370
I'll whip your asses.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:26.410
And fuckin' slaughter ya!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.250
♬ "Addicted"? You're really dead now! ♬

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.410
♬ First I'll snap off
Your two little lightning rods ♬

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.540
♬ You recovered awful quick ♬

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.370
♬ But don't put a damper on things
'cause I'm on fire ♬

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.200
♬ Never gave a damn about human life ♬

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:38.500
♬ Your concern for the weak
is something I despise ♬

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.790
♬ Love can't change who lives and who dies ♬

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.410
♬ It's just cardiac arrest causing your demise ♬

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:55.790
Who're you gonna treat with
your body all battered and torn, Doc?

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:58.500
There ain't no one in the waiting room.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.950
There's you.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:04.540
You wish! I'll put all three
of you in your hospital!

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:07.620
Samatoki, this may be the end.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:12.290
I'll give you everything I've--we've got!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.120
♬ You dream of strength
When all life is but a dream ♬

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.250
♬ I implore you, listen to me
Samatoki, my friend ♬

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.250
♬ In order that I might honor these bonds of mine ♬

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.290
♬ Today, I, Jakurai
Shall bare my fangs ♬

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.830
♬ The horse, rabbit, and bush warbler
Burn their bodies in the pyre ♬

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.200
♬ As a sacrifice to the wolves ♬

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.250
♬ Matenro shall consume their flesh and souls ♬

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.120
♬ Our bites are not for sport
For we are the divine lupine ♬

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:37.040
I-I don't believe it...
This is... the bond of Matenro?!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:45.080
Jyuto... Rio... I've let you down.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.870
And the winner is... Matenro!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:57.700
Doppo. Hifumi.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.120
--Doctor...
--We...

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:03.200
This was a battle that
either team could have won.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:08.410
Now, in this instant, our bond
has narrowly prevailed over them.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:16.580
And the First Division
Rap Battle Champion is... Matenro!
